WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.000
Ingredients will change a bit.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.700
Maybe some more protein stuff
and vegetarian stuff.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.400
Then waste is going to be
more bigger thing,

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.900
so try to minimize that
as much as possible.
